      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "NEWTOWN BRETT (1) was impressive last time, posting an effortless 5 lengths win in taking a Grade 6 in 20.27 and a new Best time this course and distance. Expected to go close again if runs up to latest. MILCHICK (2) doesn't show much early dash but winds into his races, hitting the line hard to place two back then came home strongly into third (25.72) in a Grade 5 at Q Lakeside last time. Has a good record at this journey. Yet to win out of this box but has been in the placings two times from four starts. Well placed and gets his chance. BROTHER SAM (7) has shown good improvement at his last two starts, hitting the frame latest when 2nd at Q Straight over 350m. Expected to feature again. ICE RIDER (3) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
